title: "Aprendizaje por refuerzo para trading en mercados eléctricos: diseño del entorno, algoritmos, herramientas y evidencia aplicada"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: "Martin Hernández"
    given-names: "Esther M."
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - electricity markets
  - energy trading
  - PPO
  - actor-critic
  - intraday market
  - imbalance
  - temporal backtesting
abstract: >-
  Narrative and technical review of reinforcement learning for electricity-market
  trading, covering environment design, observations, actions, rewards, constraints,
  algorithm families, implementation tools, applied evidence, temporal evaluation,
  and implications for the Iberian electricity market.
